# Refusals that name no way out, frozen the day the ratchet was written (0287).
#
# This file only shrinks. A sentence here whose refusal later names a command must
# be deleted, and a count here must go down when a call stops building its message
# from a value. The test reports both directions; adding a line is a deliberate act
# a reviewer sees in the diff, never a way to make the suite green in a hurry.
sentence	check.go	a change that names itself in a trailer lives on a branch, not on : move the commits to a branch and run again
sentence	check.go	could not find the merge-base with :
sentence	check.go	could not read the commit message : ; git runs the hook inside the repository
sentence	check.go	could not read the commits since :
count	check.go	5
